            "preview": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"01M63R4QSRH3KHZBJ26QM3QJ5T\",\"from\":\"tester@carlos-pc\",\"sent\":\"2026-10-29T12:20:00.000Z\",\"kind\":\"task\",\"to\":\"reviewer@carlos-pc\",\"title\":\"paste this thread into the postmortem\",\"body\":\"Thread pegado de #incident (2026-10-29), tal cual:\\n\\nana  09:12  el indexer vuelve a estar ca\u00eddo, el healthcheck da 503\\nluis 09:13  \u00bfotra vez el lock de sync.ts?\\nana  09:13  pinta a eso. Log:\\n\\n```\\nERROR archive/sync.ts:214 lock \\\"sync\\\" held by pid 4812 for 00:41:07\\nretrying in 30s (attempt 7/10)\\n```\\n\\nluis 09:15  ese proceso muri\u00f3 el viernes, el lock es un fichero hu\u00e9rfano\\nana  09:16  si, `rm ~/.cache/slack-browser-mcp/sync.lock` y arranca bien\\nluis 09:17  hay que hacer que el lock caduque, no que lo borremos a mano\\n\\n```ts\\nconst lock = await acquire({ path, staleAfterMs: 10 * 60_000 })\\nif (!lock) throw new Error(\\\"another sync is running\\\")\\n```\\n\\nana  09:20  \\\"staleAfterMs\\\" ya existe pero el default es Infinity, por eso no caduca\\nluis 09:21  cambiamos el default a 10m y a\u00f1adimos el pid al mensaje...",
            "preview_highlight": "<div class=\"CodeMirror cm-s-default CodeMirrorServer\">\n<div class=\"CodeMirror-code\">\n<div><pre>{<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;v&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-number\">1</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;id&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;01M63R4QSRH3KHZBJ26QM3QJ5T&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;from&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;tester@carlos-pc&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;sent&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;2026-10-29T12:20:00.000Z&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;kind&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;task&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;to&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;reviewer@carlos-pc&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;title&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;paste this thread into the postmortem&quot;</span>,<span class=\"cm-string cm-property\">&quot;body&quot;</span>:<span class=\"cm-string\">&quot;Thread pegado de #incident (2026-10-29), tal cual:\\n\\nana  09:12  el indexer vuelve a estar ca\u00eddo, el healthcheck da 503\\nluis 09:13  \u00bfotra vez el lock de sync.ts?\\nana  09:13  pinta a eso. Log:\\n\\n```\\nERROR archive/sync.ts:214 lock \\&quot;sync\\&quot; held by pid 4812 for 00:41:07\\nretrying in 30s (attempt 7/10)\\n```\\n\\nluis 09:15  ese proceso muri\u00f3 el viernes, el lock es un fichero hu\u00e9rfano\\nana  09:16  si, `rm ~/.cache/slack-browser-mcp/sync.lock` y arranca bien\\nluis 09:17  hay que hacer que el lock caduque, no que lo borremos a mano\\n\\n```ts\\nconst lock = await acquire({ path, staleAfterMs: 10 * 60_000 })\\nif (!lock) throw new Error(\\&quot;another sync is running\\&quot;)\\n```\\n\\nana  09:20  \\&quot;staleAfterMs\\&quot; ya existe pero el default es Infinity, por eso no caduca\\nluis 09:21  cambiamos el default a 10m y a\u00f1adimos el pid al mensaje...</span></pre></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
